  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internat.Panel of Parliamentarians for Freedom of Religion or Belief ODA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of this project is to promote freedom of religion or belief, focusing on the role parliamentarians from developing countries can play as agents of change. The project has a specific goal to  recruit and empower more women parliamentarians, ensure gender balance within the coalition, and address the intersectionality between FoRB and gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
